@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #C9A75A
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2FA
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #3C6382
hide footbox
title Вариант 16 · Happy Flow\nСвободный буфер и свободный GPU-узел
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
autonumber

participant "Движок" as E
participant "Камера" as S
control "Постановка" as P
queue "Буфер" as B
control "Выбор LIFO" as D
participant "GPU-пул" as W
participant "Календарь" as C

E -> S: generate(now)
S --> E: request (кадр)
E -> P: place(request, now)
P -> B: findFreeByRing()
B --> P: position (свободно)
P -> B: put(request, position)
P --> E: null (без выбивания)

E -> D: dispatch(now)
D -> W: findFreeByRing()
W --> D: workerId
D -> B: extractLIFO()
B --> D: request
D -> W: start(workerId, request, now)
W --> D: finishTime = now + Exp(μ)
D -> C: add(COMPLETION(finishTime, ...))

note over E,W
При одном now: постановка → LIFO-выбор → старт обслуживания.
Указатель приборов сдвигается.
end note
@enduml
